    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061119.0021\n\nHANOI, Nov. 19 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nURGENT: Russia, US sign agreement on WTO deal in Vietnam\n\n\n\n\nRussia and the United States Sunday signed a bilateral agreement on Russia's accession to the World Trade Organization (WTO) on the sidelines of the ongoing Asia- Pacific Economic Cooperaiton Economic Leaders' Meeting in Hanoi.",
